        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>拼接面料工艺说明</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .row-top {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 25px;\n  }\n  .cell {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 140px;\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #888;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .quad {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 140px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 2px;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n  }\n  .quad .sub {\n    background: #eee;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .row-mid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .row-mid .placeholder {\n    height: 220px;\n  }\n  .text-block {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .text-block.en {\n    font-style: normal;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"row-top\">\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">拼接抽刀面料</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: black &amp; white fringed fur garment on model]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">毛皮镂空拼接面料</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: light beige textured fur/leather bag detail]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">拼接面料</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: white ribbed fur fabric strips]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">拼接编织面料</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: white woven braided fabric texture]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">拼接工艺</div>\n      <div class=\"quad\">\n        <div class=\"sub\">[Texture 1: chevron knit]</div>\n        <div class=\"sub\">[Texture 2: beige woven]</div>\n        <div class=\"sub\">[Texture 3: light zigzag]</div>\n        <div class=\"sub\">[Texture 4: dark zigzag]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row-mid\">\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">抽刀拼接面料</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: model wearing striped blue/white fringed vest]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">加入一些兔毛面料</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: white fluffy rabbit fur texture close-up]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"caption\">拼接裘皮面料</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: dark blue chevron patterned fur fabric]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-block cn\">\n    本系列面料使用裘皮与针织加入少量彩色进行设计,将不同品种的裘皮进行拼接染色等工艺再造。或者将裘皮与其他面料进行拼接缝纹产生,特别的效果,再其次将裘皮进行不同颜色的拼接进行不同肌理感觉,黑白仔面料到采用拼接掉穿插,抽丝做出肌理感在加入印花系列标志使整个系列更加突出主题,并且使用裘皮反复合大黑素材。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-block en\">\n    This series of fabrics is designed by adding a small amount of black and white jeans to fur and knitting. Different kinds of fur are reconstructed by splicing and dyeing, or the fur is spliced and wound with other fabrics.Special effect, secondly, fur is spliced with different colors to give different feeling of texture, black denim fabric is interspersed with splicing, silk drawing to make texture feeling in addition to the printing series logo to make the wholeSeries more prominent theme, and the use of fur match the requirements of the competition.\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
